<title>MALAYSIA: Khong Guan share suspension extended.</title>
<headline>Khong Guan share suspension extended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A suspension of trading in the shares of Khong Guan Holdings Bhd has been extended by five trading days from June 17, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the extension was to allow the company to complete a deal to buy two properties in southern Johor state.</p>
<p>The stock of the property and confectionary company stock was last traded on May 30 at 10.60 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
